 "extra_note": "The Outback Express and the runs it serves were missing from OpenStreetMap and were traced 2026-11-18. OpenStreetMap has since mapped the Outback Express and the Outback runs (Elk Run, Oh, Bob, Wildcat, Bighorn, Porcupine, The Willows, Lodgepole, Pika Glades, Wildfire, Wolverine, Mr. Toad's Wild Ride, South Bowl Trees, Puma Bowl, Wombat Chutes, Bingo, South Bowl, Tele Trees) along the cut runs in the aerial photos, so those hand-drawn copies were removed on 2026-11-23 (they drew each run twice, and the copies' ends joined nothing). Still drawn by hand: The Black Forest and the back bowls OpenStreetMap lacks (North, Erickson, Bergman and Independence bowls, The Windows); approximate, within about 100 m.",
