 "links_note": "Hike-to terrain, as the official trail map shows it: the ridge east of the Dercum summit (Summit House) to the North Peak double blacks; Independence, Erickson and Bergman bowls and Wapiti Peak from the Bergman Express; North and South Bowl from the Outback Express. Directions show these joins as a walk. The Outback Express joins to Wolverine, The Trap, Mr. Toad's Wild Ride, Wildfire, Conquest, Pika Glades, Victory Chutes, Puma Bowl, The Stadium and South Bowl Trees, and Bighorn to Porcupine, were removed on 2026-11-23: OpenStreetMap's own Outback runs start at the lift top and join each other, and the old joins made straight 160-500 m cuts through the trees."
